      ∃ a < R, ∃ C, (0 < C ∨ 0 < R) ∧ ∀ (n : ℕ), |f n| ≤ C * a ^ n,
      ∃ a ∈ Ioo 0 R, ∃ C > 0, ∀ (n : ℕ), |f n| ≤ C * a ^ n, ∃ a < R, ∀ᶠ (n : ℕ) in atTop, |f n| ≤ a ^ n,
